      "id": "finding-1-3-the-adapter-adds-a-three-part-preflight-that-no-earlier-kind-performs-in-this-sh",
      "text": "The adapter adds a three-part preflight that no earlier kind performs in this shape: a `command -v vibe` PATH probe, an exact version gate on `3.1.2` run inside a throwaway `VIBE_HOME` outside the checkout, and a roster check against `VIBE_ALLOWED_MODELS`. A missing binary, a wrong version or an off-roster alias each throw before the lineage launches. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3101-3102] [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3163-3190]",
