    {
      "id": "finding-1-2-the-kind-adds-a-dedicated-fan-out-adapter-buildvibelineagecommand-registered-in-",
      "text": "The kind adds a dedicated fan-out adapter, `buildVibeLineageCommand`, registered in `LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS`. It runs Vibe in print mode only, and it builds the command as `vibe --prompt-file <lineage>/vibe-prompt.txt --output-dir <lineage>/vibe-output --trust --model <alias> --auto-approve`, with `cwd` set to the lineage directory and `VIBE_HOME` pointed at `<lineage>/vibe-home`. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3154-3250] [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3256]",
