    {
      "id": "finding-1-4-the-kind-adds-the-fan-out-s-first-per-lineage-outcome-read-from-an-executor-s-ow",
      "text": "The kind adds the fan-out's first per-lineage outcome read from an executor's own export record. `resolveVibeLineageOutcome` scores `vibe-output/export.json`: exit 0 with `exit_code` 0 and `outcome` absent or `finished` is `success`; exit 3 with an export present is `partial` and never counts as success; anything else, including a clean exit with no export, is `failure`. The verdict is attached to the settled pool result as `result.outcome` for Vibe lineages only. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3131-3152] [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4244-4250] [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4477-4485]",
